.DS_Store

# Real secrets, never the template that documents them. Keep the negation last: a later
# broad `.env*` line (Vercel CLI appends one) would silently re-ignore the template.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Working docs — specs, handoffs, research notes. Directory-anchored on purpose: these were once
# bare filename patterns, which silently protected any SPEC.md anywhere and would have stopped
# protecting these the moment one was renamed or moved.
.agents/work/
.lavish/
.claude/
consensus.html
.venv/
.build/
.gradle/
build/
local.properties
.idea/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.vercel
